---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy — Simba & Good" description="How Simba & Good collects, uses, and protects your information." path="/privacy">
  <main class="doc"><div class="narrow">
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: 24 August 2026</p>

    <p>
      This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>Simba &amp; Good</strong> ("Simba &amp; Good",
      "we", "us", or "our") collects, uses, and protects information when you interact
      with our website, the Seasons mobile application, Shop for Good, For Brands,
      and related services (together, the "Services").
    </p>

    <p>
      Simba &amp; Good is currently in the process of being incorporated in Singapore.
      Once incorporated, this policy will be updated with our full legal entity name
      and registered details.
    </p>

    <p>
      We are building Simba &amp; Good around pets, not around collecting information
      about people. We aim to keep the personal information we collect about pet owners
      to a minimum and primarily collect information needed to provide our Services.
    </p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>

    <h3>Information about you</h3>
    <p>Depending on how you use our Services, we may collect:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your name or preferred name.</li>
      <li>Your email address.</li>
      <li>Your phone number, if you choose to provide it.</li>
      <li>Account and sign-in information, including information provided through Sign in with Apple.</li>
      <li>Subscription information, such as your plan and subscription status.</li>
      <li>Information you provide when contacting us or requesting support.</li>
      <li>Marketing or waitlist information, such as your email address if you sign up for updates.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Pet information</h3>
    <p>
      Seasons is designed around your pet. You may choose to provide information such as:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Pet name.</li>
      <li>Species.</li>
      <li>Breed.</li>
      <li>Sex.</li>
      <li>Date of birth or approximate age.</li>
      <li>Weight.</li>
      <li>Photos.</li>
      <li>Life stage.</li>
      <li>Vaccination information.</li>
      <li>Allergies.</li>
      <li>Medications.</li>
      <li>Health information.</li>
      <li>Dietary information.</li>
      <li>Behavioural information.</li>
      <li>Activity and care information.</li>
      <li>Other information you choose to provide about your pet.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Shop for Good</h3>
    <p>
      If you purchase something through Shop for Good, we may collect information
      necessary to process and fulfil your order, including:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Name.</li>
      <li>Email address.</li>
      <li>Delivery and billing information.</li>
      <li>Order and product details.</li>
      <li>Delivery information.</li>
      <li>Returns, refunds, and customer-support information.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      Payments may be processed by third-party payment providers. We do not intend to
      store your full payment card details unless expressly stated at the time of purchase.
    </p>

    <h3>For Brands</h3>
    <p>
      <strong>For Brands</strong> is Simba &amp; Good's agency and business-services offering.
      If you contact us or work with us as a brand, business, agency, or other organisation,
      we may collect limited professional information such as:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your name.</li>
      <li>Job title or role.</li>
      <li>Company or organisation name.</li>
      <li>Business email address.</li>
      <li>Business phone number.</li>
      <li>Project, campaign, or partnership information.</li>
      <li>Commercial and billing information.</li>
      <li>Communications and correspondence.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
    <p>
      When you visit our website or use our Services, we may automatically collect
      limited technical and usage information, such as:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>IP address.</li>
      <li>Device type.</li>
      <li>Operating system.</li>
      <li>Browser type.</li>
      <li>App version.</li>
      <li>Device identifiers.</li>
      <li>Approximate location derived from technical information.</li>
      <li>Pages or screens visited.</li>
      <li>Features used.</li>
      <li>Crash and diagnostic information.</li>
      <li>Basic usage and analytics information.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use your information</h2>
    <p>We may use information we collect to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Provide, operate, and maintain Seasons.</li>
      <li>Create and manage your pet profiles.</li>
      <li>Personalise your experience and your pet's care information.</li>
      <li>Provide reminders, records, recommendations, and other features.</li>
      <li>Process and fulfil Shop for Good orders.</li>
      <li>Process subscriptions and payments.</li>
      <li>Provide customer support.</li>
      <li>Respond to enquiries and business opportunities.</li>
      <li>Provide services to brand and agency clients.</li>
      <li>Send service-related communications.</li>
      <li>Send marketing communications where permitted and where you have opted in when required.</li>
      <li>Improve existing products and develop new features.</li>
      <li>Understand how our Services are used.</li>
      <li>Maintain the security and integrity of our Services.</li>
      <li>Detect and prevent fraud, abuse, or misuse.</li>
      <li>Comply with applicable laws and legal obligations.</li>
      <li>Protect our rights, users, and business.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Pet health information</h2>
    <p>
      Seasons may allow you to record or receive information relating to your pet's
      health, including symptoms, medications, vaccinations, allergies, conditions,
      veterinary visits, and other health-related information.
    </p>

    <div class="highlight">
      <strong>Pet health information is provided for informational purposes only.</strong>
      Seasons is not a veterinary service and does not provide veterinary diagnosis,
      treatment, or emergency veterinary care. If your pet is experiencing an emergency,
      serious symptoms, or rapidly deteriorating health, contact a qualified veterinarian
      or emergency veterinary service immediately.
    </div>

    <h2>Artificial intelligence</h2>
    <p>
      Some Seasons features may use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or
      automated systems to provide recommendations, summaries, reminders, explanations,
      or other content.
    </p>
    <p>
      Where these technologies are used, information may be processed by third-party
      technology providers that support those features. We aim to provide only the
      information reasonably necessary for the relevant feature.
    </p>
    <p>
      AI-generated information may be inaccurate, incomplete, outdated, or unsuitable
      for your particular pet. AI-generated information should not be treated as
      veterinary diagnosis or professional veterinary advice.
    </p>

    <h2>Relevant partner offers</h2>
    <p>
      We may offer an optional feature that allows you to receive relevant offers,
      products, or recommendations from partner brands based on information about your
      pet, such as its species, breed, age, or life stage.
    </p>
    <p>
      This feature is optional and will only operate as described to you at the time
      you enable it. You may turn it off at any time.
    </p>
    <p>
      We do <strong>not sell your personal information</strong>. Where partner offers
      are provided, we aim to provide partners with only the information reasonably
      necessary to facilitate the relevant experience and do not provide partners
      with personal information that directly identifies you unless you have expressly
      agreed to it or it is otherwise permitted by law.
    </p>

    <h2>Subscriptions</h2>
    <p>
      Paid Seasons subscriptions may be offered through Apple's App Store.
      Apple processes payments and manages your Apple account and payment credentials.
      Simba &amp; Good does not receive or store your full payment card details.
    </p>
    <p>
      We may use subscription-management providers such as RevenueCat to manage
      subscription status and entitlements. These providers may receive information
      necessary to determine and manage your subscription.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
    <p>
      Our website and applications may use cookies, software development kits,
      analytics tools, pixels, and similar technologies.
    </p>
    <p>These technologies may help us to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Operate our Services.</li>
      <li>Remember preferences.</li>
      <li>Understand usage.</li>
      <li>Improve performance and user experience.</li>
      <li>Diagnose technical problems.</li>
      <li>Measure the effectiveness of features and communications.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Sharing your information</h2>
    <p>
      We may share information with trusted service providers that help us operate
      our Services, including providers of:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Cloud hosting and infrastructure.</li>
      <li>Authentication and account services.</li>
      <li>Subscription management.</li>
      <li>Payment processing.</li>
      <li>Email and communications.</li>
      <li>Analytics and diagnostics.</li>
      <li>Customer support.</li>
      <li>AI and machine-learning services.</li>
      <li>Shop for Good fulfilment and delivery.</li>
      <li>Security and fraud prevention.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      We may also disclose information where required by law, regulation, court order,
      or government authority, or where reasonably necessary to protect the rights,
      safety, property, or security of Simba &amp; Good, our users, or others.
    </p>

    <p><strong>We do not sell your personal information.</strong></p>

    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
    <p>
      Our Services may contain links to or integrations with third-party services.
      These third parties may have their own privacy policies and terms.
      We are not responsible for the privacy practices or security of third-party services.
    </p>

    <h2>International transfers</h2>
    <p>
      Some of our service providers may operate outside Singapore or outside your
      country of residence. Your information may therefore be processed or stored
      internationally.
    </p>
    <p>
      Where required by applicable law, we will take reasonable steps to ensure that
      personal information transferred internationally receives an appropriate level
      of protection.
    </p>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>
      We retain information for as long as reasonably necessary to provide our Services,
      maintain your account, fulfil transactions, provide customer support, meet legal
      obligations, resolve disputes, prevent fraud, and enforce our agreements.
    </p>
    <p>
      When information is no longer reasonably required, we will take reasonable steps
      to delete, anonymise, or otherwise dispose of it.
    </p>

    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>
      We use reasonable technical and organisational measures designed to protect
      information against unauthorised access, collection, use, disclosure, copying,
      modification, disposal, or similar risks.
    </p>
    <p>
      No internet transmission or electronic storage system can be guaranteed to be
      completely secure.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Depending on where you live and which laws apply to you, you may have rights
      to access, correct, delete, export, or restrict certain uses of your personal
      information, and to withdraw consent for certain processing.
    </p>
    <p>
      To exercise applicable rights or ask questions about your information, contact
      us at <a href="mailto:privacy@simbaandgood.com">privacy@simbaandgood.com</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Where you withdraw consent, we may no longer be able to provide certain features
      or Services that depend on that information. We may also retain or continue
      processing information where permitted or required by law.
    </p>

    <h2>Marketing communications</h2>
    <p>
      If you choose to receive marketing communications, we may send you information
      about Simba &amp; Good, Seasons, Shop for Good, new features, products,
      promotions, events, partnerships, and relevant pet-related content.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can unsubscribe from marketing communications at any time using the
      unsubscribe mechanism provided in the communication.
    </p>
    <p>
      We may continue to send essential service-related communications, including
      account, security, subscription, transaction, or order notifications.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      Our Services are intended for adults and are not directed specifically at children.
      We do not knowingly collect personal information from children without appropriate
      authorisation.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you believe that a child has provided personal information to us without
      appropriate consent, please contact us.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time as our Services develop,
      our practices change, or applicable laws change.
    </p>
    <p>
      We will post the updated version on this page and update the "Last updated"
      date above. Where appropriate, we may also notify you through the Services
      or by email.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this Privacy Policy or your personal information:
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Simba &amp; Good</strong><br />
      Singapore<br />
      <a href="mailto:privacy@simbaandgood.com">privacy@simbaandgood.com</a>
    </p>
    <p>
      Once Simba &amp; Good is incorporated, this section will be updated with our
      full legal entity name and registered address.
    </p>
  </div></main>

  <style>
    .doc{padding:56px 0 80px}
    .narrow{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
    .doc h1{font-size:clamp(32px,4.6vw,46px);margin:14px 0 8px}
    .updated{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-bottom:28px}
    .doc h2{font-size:22px;margin:36px 0 10px}
    .doc h3{font-size:18px;margin:26px 0 8px}
    .doc p,.doc li{color:#37423b;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65}
    .doc ul{padding-left:20px}
    .doc li{margin:6px 0}
    .highlight{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid var(--gold);border-radius:10px;padding:16px 20px;margin:14px 0}
  </style>
</Base>